<h1>Algorithm Visualizer</h1>
<p>Phase 1 establishes the project architecture. Algorithms and visualizations are intentionally not implemented yet.</p>

<ul>
    <li><code>AlgorithmVisualizer.Core</code> — pure C# logic with no Blazor dependency.</li>
    <li><code>AlgorithmVisualizer.Client</code> — pages, SVG visualization, playback controls, and UI state.</li>
    <li><code>tests</code> — reserved for focused data-structure and algorithm tests.</li>
</ul>
